<!--
本期摘要頁（genomics-prototype，2026-09-01 整頁改寫成 EDM 版型）。
讀者動線：摘要頁（TLDR＋每則標題副標摘要）→ 點「閱讀全文」進單篇頁
（topic_detail，同版型）→ 單篇頁可退回這裡。跟 EDM 信件是同一套視覺，
信件、摘要頁、全文頁三個地方看起來是同一份刊物。
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ issue_title }}</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; padding: 24px 12px; background-color: #eef1f4;
         font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", "PingFang TC", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .card { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d8dee4; }

  .head { background-color: #1f4e8c; padding: 28px 32px; }
  .head .eyebrow { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #bcd0e8; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .head .brand { font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; margin: 0; }
  .head .meta { font-size: 13px; color: #bcd0e8; margin: 8px 0 0; }

  .tldr { margin: 24px 32px 0; padding: 16px 20px; background: #f2f6fb; border: 1px solid #d5e2f2; }
  .tldr-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #1f4e8c; margin: 0; }
  .tldr-group { font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #1c2b38; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .tldr ul { margin: 6px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  .tldr li { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3a4652; }

  .item { padding: 24px 32px 8px; }
  .item + .item { border-top: 1px solid #e6ebf0; }
  .chips { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .chip { display: inline-block; background: #eef3fa; border: 1px solid #c5d4e8; padding: 2px 8px;
          font-size: 11px; color: #1f4e8c; margin-right: 6px; }
  .item h2 { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }
  .item h2 a { color: #173a66; text-decoration: none; }
  .subhead { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1f4e8c; margin: 4px 0 0; }
  .teaser { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3a4652; margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .links { margin: 10px 0 16px; }
  .links a { font-size: 12px; text-decoration: underline; }
  .links .read { color: #1f4e8c; }
  .links .src { color: #5a6672; }
  .links .sep { color: #9aa5b0; font-size: 12px; }

  .foot { background: #f6f7f9; border-top: 1px solid #d8dee4; padding: 16px 32px; margin-top: 16px;
          font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: #5a6672; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
  <div class="head">
    <p class="eyebrow">DELTA · NBDMD</p>
    <p class="brand">{{ newsletter_name }}</p>
    <p class="meta">{{ issue_date }}｜第 {{ issue_no }} 期｜共 {{ total_articles }} 則</p>
  </div>

  {% if tldr %}
  <div class="tldr">
    <p class="tldr-title">本期 TL;DR</p>
    {% if tldr.trends %}
    <p class="tldr-group">趨勢</p>
    <ul>{% for item in tldr.trends %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    {% endif %}
    {% if tldr.highlights %}
    <p class="tldr-group">重點</p>
    <ul>{% for item in tldr.highlights %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    {% endif %}
    {% if tldr.observations %}
    <p class="tldr-group">觀察</p>
    <ul>{% for item in tldr.observations %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% for topic in topics %}
  <div class="item">
    <div class="chips">
      {% if topic.primary_tag %}<span class="chip">{{ topic.primary_tag }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <h2><a href="/issues/{{ issue_id }}/topics/{{ topic.id }}">{{ topic.chosen_headline }}</a></h2>
    {% if topic.chosen_subhead %}<p class="subhead">{{ topic.chosen_subhead }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% if topic.card_summary %}<p class="teaser">{{ topic.card_summary.text }}</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="links">
      <a class="read" href="/issues/{{ issue_id }}/topics/{{ topic.id }}">閱讀全文</a>
      {% if topic.source_url %}
      <span class="sep">&nbsp;·&nbsp;</span>
      <a class="src" href="{{ topic.source_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">原文出處</a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="foot">
    本報由自動化系統產出，每則均附原文出處。僅供台達內部參考，請勿外流。
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
